{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851180/extras/b411c56c6a43375d5d2859f920dfb8fd.avif?t=1760982531\" width=1282 height=304 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You\u2019re a former arms dealer, fresh out of prison and back in Blizwood with no cash, no product, and no connections. Rebuild your empire from the ground up, navigating between the watchful eyes of the authorities and the lure of profit.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd2b Craft a variety of weapons, each with its own unique assembly process. Over time, gain access to improved materials and components to produce higher-quality, more profitable gear. Track how your creations impact the world by following reactions on social media.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851180/extras/5fa8146256e18bb023bda32f1520dd9b.poster.avif?t=1760982531\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851180/extras/5fa8146256e18bb023bda32f1520dd9b.webm?t=1760982531\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851180/extras/5fa8146256e18bb023bda32f1520dd9b.mp4?t=1760982531\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udeb2 Travel on foot, by BMX, or behind the wheel to deliver goods to your clients. Hire people to work the streets and grow your operations. In the later stages, set up cross-border smuggling routes to tap into new markets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfe2 Purchase new properties for workshops and production facilities, hire staff, and build a fully automated manufacturing and logistics chain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udea8 It\u2019s a dangerous business \u2014 you\u2019ll have to deal with inspections and raids.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3851180?t=1760982531","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851180/425dd1e6a5f4f92b80f87f62ec58d45d74eb02c4/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760982531","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851180/5a223bf7a0bdcc7f3ecbe50a0616e6b1e996b401/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760982531","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851180/5a223bf7a0bdcc7f3ecbe50a0616e6b1e996b401/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760982531","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game depicts the simplified production, distribution and sale of illegal weapons. It also contains non-realistic violence in the form of melee and firearm combat."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851180/extras/b411c56c6a43375d5d2859f920dfb8fd.avif?t=1760982531\" width=1282 height=304 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You\u2019re a former arms dealer, fresh out of prison and back in Blizwood with no cash, no product, and no connections. Rebuild your empire from the ground up, navigating between the watchful eyes of the authorities and the lure of profit.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd2b Craft a variety of weapons, each with its own unique assembly process. Over time, gain access to improved materials and components to produce higher-quality, more profitable gear. Track how your creations impact the world by following reactions on social media.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851180/extras/5fa8146256e18bb023bda32f1520dd9b.poster.avif?t=1760982531\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851180/extras/5fa8146256e18bb023bda32f1520dd9b.webm?t=1760982531\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851180/extras/5fa8146256e18bb023bda32f1520dd9b.mp4?t=1760982531\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udeb2 Travel on foot, by BMX, or behind the wheel to deliver goods to your clients. Hire people to work the streets and grow your operations. In the later stages, set up cross-border smuggling routes to tap into new markets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfe2 Purchase new properties for workshops and production facilities, hire staff, and build a fully automated manufacturing and logistics chain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udea8 It\u2019s a dangerous business \u2014 you\u2019ll have to deal with inspections and raids.</p>","developers":["Centum Dev"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.co